        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "According to customer needs and preferences, we provide professional services including home design, construction, customized furniture and soft furnishings delivery, as well as post-sales support, to create an ideal and comfortable living space for our customers.",
        "start_character": 50381,
        "end_character": 50645
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048109",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048109-cbbea527739f7e30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048109",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we become a more trusted platform and the relationship between the agents on our platform and housing customers deepens, we are able to extend to other service verticals that are incidental to home ownership and other ecosystem participants.",
        "start_character": 14999,
        "end_character": 15243
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048109",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048109-cbbea527739f7e30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048109",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we believe the success of our platform substantially hinges on the efficiency and service quality of the agents on our platform, we are fully committed to sharing our accumulated industry know-hows with the agents and home renovation and other service providers on our platform through offline trainings and online courses.",
        "start_character": 29679,
        "end_character": 30005
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048109",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048109-cbbea527739f7e30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048109",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "At the design stage: we built an AI-driven end-to-end integrated design toolchain that significantly improves design efficiency and establishes a scalable, replicable design service capability.",
        "start_character": 39921,
        "end_character": 40114
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048109",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048109-cbbea527739f7e30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048109",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Based on the foregoing, we are not required to complete filing with the CSRC for our prior overseas offerings at this stage, but we may be subject to the filing requirements for our future capital raising activities under the measures.",
        "start_character": 247147,
        "end_character": 247382
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048109",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048109-cbbea527739f7e30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048109",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By driving design productization through BIM and integrated product module libraries, we have further strengthened our ability to deliver standardized services at scale.",
        "start_character": 54230,
        "end_character": 54399
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048109",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048109-cbbea527739f7e30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048109",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By standardizing work processes and integrating industry best practices into our digital systems, we aim to continuously enable service providers to deliver high-quality residential services to our customers.",
        "start_character": 13284,
        "end_character": 13492
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048109",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048109-cbbea527739f7e30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048109",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "During the tenancy period, we also provide AI-powered post-tenancy service tools that enhance response efficiency for both landlords and tenants, increasing the rate of online issue resolution.",
        "start_character": 41968,
        "end_character": 42161
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048109",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048109-cbbea527739f7e30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048109",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For home rental services, we generate revenues by providing rental property management and operation services, leasing agency, and various other rental-related services.",
        "start_character": 14678,
        "end_character": 14847
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048109",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048109-cbbea527739f7e30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048109",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For new home transaction services, we promote joint promises with new home developers to avoid customer information leakage, customer poaching and other violations, aiming to enhance the sense of security during agents’ operations.",
        "start_character": 20181,
        "end_character": 20412
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048109",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048109-cbbea527739f7e30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048109",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For new home transaction services, we recognize revenues from sales commissions charged to real estate developers.",
        "start_character": 14444,
        "end_character": 14558
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-048109",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-048109-cbbea527739f7e30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-048109",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For our new home sales business, we also compete with numerous new home marketing services providers.",
